Murphoid wrote:
> Is it better to dip arrows into a potion of sickness or into a cursed
> potion of sickness or a blessed potion of sickness? 

Remember that using poisoned projectiles as a lawful character is bad.

The BUC status of the sickness potion doesn't matter; you always get
just poisoned <projectiles>.

> What about a cursed potion of healing?

Dipping normal projectiles in healing does not change the attribute.

But if you got poisoned projectiles and dip them into healing the
poison disappears; so it's usually just a waste (even if you can use
it to identify potions).

